sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Privy
  participant C as Company + funding wallet
  participant API as API + Supabase
  participant W as E2B preflight worker
  participant F as ChallengeFactory
  participant E as Per-challenge escrow
  participant IDX as Indexer
  C->>P: Company login
  P-->>C: Access token
  C->>C: Connect and verify Monad funding wallet
  C->>API: Privy bearer + idempotency key + connected funding wallet + public specification + private TS/JS/Python grader
  API->>W: Fresh E2B preflight and public starter/example test
  W-->>API: Strict validated GraderResult
  API->>API: Require complete public spec, confirmation, passing preflight/test, and private-store immutable grader
  API-->>C: Factory calldata + exact reward value
  C->>F: createChallenge and fund reward from the bound Privy-connected wallet
  F->>E: deploy escrow with immutable company requester
  E-->>IDX: ChallengeCreated(challengeId, commitment, terms, funding wallet)
  IDX->>API: Confirmed checkpointed live projection
  API-->>C: Publish only after indexed confirmation
  alt No passing payout before deadline
    C->>E: refundExpired after deadline
    E-->>IDX: ChallengeRefunded to immutable company wallet
  end
